    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52040" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιροσέων</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καῖρος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>close-woven</i>, only in
			gen. pl. fem., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιροσέων ὀθονέων ἀπολείβεται ὑγρὸν
					ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.107
				</span></i>
			. (Archaic spelling of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιρουσσέων</span> (trisyll.), 
				Ion.
			 gen. pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιρόεις</span>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τειχιόσης</span>
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τειχιούσσης</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				3d
			</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">vi B.C.</span>).)</div>
